ske-automotive-group-pag-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Penske","x":"So I feel strong that we can rightsize ourselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Penske","x":"So we take that, and that gives us cost reduction from the standpoint of heading the fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2019-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"So I would say the market will be. maybe $16.5 million to $17 million next year, unless there is some tariff or some other act that takes place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2019-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"And I think right now, from a tariff perspective, that's been pushed off now I think until -- sometime in for six months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"And I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"And just wanted to follow up on the previous question on SG&A, given the benefits you might see from the restructuring actions in the U.K. And then, coupled with what's going on in the truck markets, as well as Warner coming in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Murphy","x":"And then also some actions that you may be taking to reduce costs and streamline the business, just given the uncertainty and volatility, and continued pressure in the U.K. market?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"We also completed the rollout of docuPAD technology to all of our US locations, which allows us to engage customers digitally by creating and processing and securing funding of a transaction electronically while improving efficiencies, providing cost savings in our back offices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2019 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"Well, I think, one of the key things will be when you look at the UK -- remember we had -- I think we talked to you folks about a $20 million cost reduction in the UK.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2020-05-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"We're going to go to restaurants now, how are we going to sit, what are we going to do in movie theaters?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"In response, we implemented a hiring freeze, initiated expense reduction and deferred approximately $150 million in capital expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"So that's where we're spending our time with people that are back to work and not on layoff at this point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"And I think there might be a moratorium on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"The OEMs going to mitigate some of this if there is a tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"At the end of the third quarter, approximately 3% remained on furlough, we've reduced our headcount by 14% as of today our 3,700 people to approximately 23,000 worldwide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"So as we look at the model I think that we're pretty strong and where we're going to be on our cost reduction as it affects SG&A.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"You reiterated the $125 million to $150 million in cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q4-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2020 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"One of the benefits we got during -- if you got any benefit at all, during the COVID situation is where we reduced headcount about 11% on the sales side, we actually took out the lower performers and we're seeing that we're getting more units for sale or per salesman and the margins are higher.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q4-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2021 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"We've taken cost out with personnel, some of the SG&As come out there also.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2021 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"So we see that giving us some opportunity to grow and also with cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2021 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"But our focus is going to be remain expanding our CarShop businesses and making strategic and opportunistic acquisitions driving and driving further cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2021 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ward","x":"Shelley I wonder if you could talk a little bit about the balance sheet restructuring that's taken place over the last 12 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2021 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Whiston","x":"I am just curious if that was coming from operational moves or headcount reduction?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/penske-automotive-group-inc-pag-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rich Shearing","x":"Some OEMs held off from shipping product as tariff negotiations took place, limiting inventory of some brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/penske-pag-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rich Shearing","x":"We did note some pull-ahead ordering during the quarter as a result of tariffs as some customers looked to lock in lower prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/penske-pag-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Randall Seymore","x":"In Energy Solutions, we believe we are at the forefront of a rapidly growing segment that provide power solutions for data centers to support the future growth of artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger Penske","x":"Outlining at JLR cyber incident, $4 million; our social programs, $2 million to $3 million; premier truck freight and tariff impacts, $15 million; and we had a higher bad debt expense at PTS of approximately $2 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard Shearing","x":"Tariffs pulled some orders previously scheduled for delivery in Q3 up to the second quarter, while other customers remain on the sidelines due to Section 232 tariffs and ultimate resolution of the EPA 2027 Emissions Regulations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Penske","x":"Our teams have taken action to reduce the impact from these macro events through various initiatives, including headcount reduction, driving efficiencies, which should benefit future periods.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q3","e":"pag","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Shearing","x":"Despite these challenges, equity earnings from PTS were $58 million, only down $2 million from the $60 million we reported in Q3 last year as PTS has been aggressive in rightsizing its fleet, reducing expenses and preparing for the rebound in the freight environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2026-02-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Randall Seymore","x":"In Energy Solutions, this growing segment provides power solutions for data centers to support the growth of artificial intelligence and these data centers require robust infrastructure with reliable power at the core of its operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger Penske","x":"In automotive, our business was impacted by weaker premium sales in both U.S. and U.K. by tariff and BEV-related pull forward, unusually high unit sales in the prior year related to stop sale, the Land Rover cyber incidents, which resulted in 800 units of fewer sales in Q4 and the macroeconomic…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard Shearing","x":"In Q4, new unit sales at our German luxury brands declined 20% and were impacted by pull-forward activity from tariffs and the expiration of BEV credit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Shearing","x":"The PTS team continues to focus on cost reductions, including rightsizing of the fleet and operating cost reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2025 Q4","e":"pag","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Randall Seymore","x":"These steps are reducing the footprint of our Sytner Select locations, closing unprofitable franchise dealerships and reducing our headcount in the past year by 1,000 people.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/penske-pag-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"Units retailed were impacted by weather-related challenges and a difficult comparison to March 2025 when tariffs caused pull-ahead sales and lower sales in the U.S. associated with the elimination of the BEV tax credit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/penske-pag-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger S. Penske","x":"In the retail commercial truck segment, Q1 unit sales declined 9% to 3,583 units, driven by reduced order intake during Q3 and Q4 2025 following the implementation of tariffs and weakness in the freight market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/penske-pag-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard P. Shearing","x":"We also saw a near-term bump with tariff announcements in February, with a grace period for orders placed by March to avoid tariff price increases of $1,000 to $1,500 depending on heavy-duty or medium-duty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/penske-pag-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q1","e":"pag","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard P. Shearing","x":"As PTS continues to rightsize its fleet, higher fleet utilization and lower operating costs for maintenance, depreciation, and interest expense contributed to an increase in earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/penske-pag-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2026-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David Whiston","x":"And on the rebound in Class 8 demand, is onshoring from tariffs at all helping truck demand?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/penske-automotive-pag-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Maurice Choy","x":"And if there's any discount, how should we think about how this pares up with any associated pass-through of risk and costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/penske-automotive-pag-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Shearing","x":"As PTS continues to rightsize its fleet and dispose of older, higher-mileage trucks, the gain on sale declined $13 million in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/penske-automotive-pag-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAG 2026 Q2","e":"pag","d":"2026-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin MacIntosh","x":"Based on our performance year-to-da